<title>UK: Brit Air orders 3 Canadair jets worth $60 million.</title>
<headline>Brit Air orders 3 Canadair jets worth $60 million.</headline>
<dateline>FARNBOROUGH, England 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brit Air on Monday signed an order for three Canadair Regional Jet aircraft with Bombardier Inc's Regional Aircraft Division, Bombardier said.</p>
<p>The aircraft order is valued at about $60 million.</p>
<p>The order was cemented at a signing ceremony at the Farnborogh International Air Show.</p>
<p>The first of the three aircraft ordered is scheduled for delivery in November.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
